home_hero = MembershipClubHero("Welcome to Movie Fans Club", "Apka", "Ultimate", "Movie Fan Community", "Har din naye movies ke updates, exclusive screenings aur fan events ka maza lijiye", "Join Today", "Explore", "Group of friends watching a movie", [{"value":"10k+","label":"Members"},{"value":"500+","label":"Screenings Hosted"},{"value":"24/7","label":"Support"}], "Movies are the universal language of emotions.", "Raj, Founder")
